  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Post-Elections Technical Assistance to Angola</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Angola conducted elections in August 2017. Prior to the elections, Norway supported a project aimed at capacity building in the areas of democratic awareness and electoral observation (AGO-17/0002). The current project aims to expand the post-elections technical assistance to address a wider set of challenges identified from the August elections, including within the electoral management, electoral dispute processes and mechanisms, political intolerance and access to media.</narrative>
  </description>
